candidates.statement_to_voters:
If I am elected again as your Councillor, I pledge to:

Continue to challenge when our council tax money is being spent unwisely;

Support a much needed Cranbrook secondary school;

Challenge plans to build over 3000 more houses in the next 5 years, when our Victorian water and sewerage cannot cope;

Support you and our Parish in challenges with Tunbridge Wells Borough Council as they arise.
